Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 19 TL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:21.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, it’s all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:23.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did we get a Christmas cake from Chiroru too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:26.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:29.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa-san’s coming, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:30.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re you doing, Yuzuru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:34.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m making it so you can put lots of presents inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:36.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:50.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:35.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Those are Santa-san’s clothes, aren’t they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:36.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:40.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Every year, Fujimoto-kun acts as our Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:43.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who else would do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:46.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true. We’re counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…White Christmas.”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:03:00.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if Fujimoto-san is still upset with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:01.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:03.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:05.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Putting that aside, you do know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:07.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The confetti, the confetti!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:12.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yesss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:16.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:21.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:23.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You must’ve worked hard today. {Keeper: Needed to be shorter | orig line “It must’ve been a lot of work for you to be this late.“}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:26.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I’m fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.51,0:03:28.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll walk you home…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:30.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…if it’s not a problem with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:32.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:34.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:42.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s so sparkly during Christmas, it’s wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:44.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:47.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, is there something you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:49.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Something I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:50.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.91,0:03:54.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, thanks to the bazaar, I got some new toys…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:59.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, can I pick something out I think would be perfect for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:01.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A present.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:04.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:06.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Christmas, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:09.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:19.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:21.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You look busy, even though it’s Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:26.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t care about Christmas. {Keeper: orig line “That doesn’t matter to me.“}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:33.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:34.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s nothing…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:41.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:43.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:52.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:56.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You haven’t made up with Kiyokazu yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:02.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I did something to make Fujimoto-san upset with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:06.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s different from usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He won’t bully me…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:11.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He won’t even look at me…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:13.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:17.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve been wondering about that this whole time…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:24.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, it’s not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:26.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure Kiyokazu knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just that he won’t admit it. {Keeper: orig line “It’s just that he won’t admit that frankly.“}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So it’s fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:38.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:44.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if we meet up tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.49,0:05:53.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I’ll be waiting in front of the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But it’ll be cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:57.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:00.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:06.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll see you tomorrow then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:15.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Christmas in the apartment too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:19.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san, I have to get you a present too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:21.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:23.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Confetti! A whole bottle full!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:25.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.03,0:06:27.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:30.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I made this for you, Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:30.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here! {Keeper: …lol. Expression: priceless}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:36.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san became a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:41.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:49.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m late! {As usual}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:07.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:10.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re earlier than usual today, Kobato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.07,0:07:13.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re preparing for a Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:14.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:18.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san, if you don’t have any plans tonight, come to our place!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:20.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll be having a Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama’s making a feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re welcome to come. {Keeper: orig line “Come if you’d like.“}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:24.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:37.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:39.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:41.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, if you’d like, come too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:43.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,To our Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.27,0:07:46.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m working tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:48.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And Christmas is…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:51.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:52.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, you need to get going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:02.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:11.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:17.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone looks so happy on Christmas, but Fujimoto-san only looks sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:22.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure it’s because I said too much back then…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:25.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:35.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-kun became an orphan on Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{box}To Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:37.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:41.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right, little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:46.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:48.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, that’s good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:34.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-kun's mother... never came home that day. {Keeper: orig line “Kiyokazu-kun’s mother never came back since that day.“}{That’s because he’s such a wet blanket.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:43.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not long after that, Sayaka’s father took him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,59 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:13.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:15.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now let’s start the Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m done changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:25.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay Fujimoto-kun, call everyone in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:26.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:28.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:29.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:31.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go once you've changed. {Nakie dobato would be bad.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:46.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:51.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san’s a great person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:53.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:56.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s a great person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:03.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll do my best too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:17.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:22.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s all call in Santa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:23.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:26.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:29.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Santa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:30.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Santa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:31.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Santa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:34.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa-san’s here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:35.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:41.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:42.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:45.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Santa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:47.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that you, Kiyokazu-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Santa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:57.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Santa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:04.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, what presents does Santa-san have for you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa-san, presents!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:10.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Presents please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:13.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:14.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:17.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much, Santa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:18.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:20.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s eat the cake now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:21.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:34.41,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I’ll go get a present too. {Keeper: hmm… thought? He doesn’t seem to be moving his mouth}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:48.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:51.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll finish the rest of the cleanup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, it's Christmas, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:55.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop trying to look out for me. {DICK!}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, why do I have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.05,0:14:27.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:29.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Christmas is the busiest time of the year, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:30.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You slavedriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:33.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:36.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:40.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks pretty good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:50.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:56.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:07.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:10.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Since it’s Christmas, Kiyokazu was holding it all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:16.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I made things worse and hurt Fujimoto-san, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:22.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san must hate me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.31,0:15:24.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And that’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.77,0:15:28.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:31.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why does it hurt so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:45.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Does Kiyokazu concern you that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:50.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I end up thinking about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:53.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know why, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:56.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When I think about him, my chest hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.47,0:16:00.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:07.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:13.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I know the best present I can get you, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.91,0:16:25.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:32.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a Christmas present.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:36.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:39.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’d like you to give this to\NKobato-chan on the viewing platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:44.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Go. I'll take care of the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.31,0:16:47.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:51.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Christmas, yet she’s hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:52.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:55.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s hurt because of your attitude! {because you’re a douchebag!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.49,0:16:58.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.99,0:17:01.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan thinks it’s her own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She keeps wanting to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:09.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:12.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s waiting by herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.44,0:18:12.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:17.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing you should worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:21.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So, what are you getting so worked up about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:26.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, do you mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:29.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, you’re not mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:32.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:34.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn’t mad in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:35.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You’re mad at me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:42.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, don’t worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:47.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:49.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:51.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I got this from Doumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:18:58.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.65,0:19:02.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“Were you able to make up?”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:05.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“This is my present to you.”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:07.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“Sorry if he bullies you.”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:09.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:11.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“Merry Christmas.”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:16.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san’s present to me is Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:20.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What did Doumoto tell you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:23.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He said he’d bring me the perfect present.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:29.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:33.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He wanted me to make up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:36.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:39.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:42.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, it’s snowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.03,0:19:44.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:45.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s so pretty.
