Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.40,0:22:28.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Either way, when the winter\Npasses and it becomes spring…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.53,0:22:32.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be parting ways with Dobato.
